  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/SbGKuYro4oi5MfE5YaI3FNs5wpXRnpmNdsMqjZHtRo0.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />Applying conservation of linear momentum<br />$\\Rightarrow \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{P}}_{\\mathrm{i}}=\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{P}}_{\\mathrm{f}}(\\because \\mathrm{P}=\\mathrm{mv})$<br />$m v_1+2 m v_2=(m+2 m) v^{\\prime}$<br />$m v^1+2 m \\times 0=(3 m) v^{\\prime}$<br />$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{mv}=3 \\mathrm{mv}^{\\prime} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{v}^{\\prime}=\\frac{\\mathrm{v}}{3}$",
